<section class="blk">
  <div class="eyebrow">Section 3</div><h2 class="rv">Product objectives</h2>
  <div class="tw rv"><table class=""><thead><tr><th class="c-id">ID</th><th class="c-def">Objective</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="c-id">BO-01</td><td class="c-def">Deliver visual work management that needs no training to adopt.</td></tr><tr><td class="c-id">BO-02</td><td class="c-def">Make the board the single place a team agrees on what is happening.</td></tr><tr><td class="c-id">BO-03</td><td class="c-def">Remove manual upkeep of project data through automation and intelligence.</td></tr><tr><td class="c-id">BO-04</td><td class="c-def">Operate natively in Arabic and English without either feeling like a translation.</td></tr><tr><td class="c-id">BO-05</td><td class="c-def">Scale from one person to enterprise governance without changing platform.</td></tr><tr><td class="c-id">BO-06</td><td class="c-def">Keep the core lean and deliver depth through extensions.</td></tr><tr><td class="c-id">BO-07</td><td class="c-def">Expose every capability through an open API so nothing is trapped in the interface.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
</section>

