ity within a single list."><td class="c-id">FR-C-08</td><td class="c-req">Watch list</td><td class="c-def">Subscribe to notifications for activity within a single list.</td></tr><tr data-blob="fr-c-09 move all cards bulk-move every card in a list to another list."><td class="c-id">FR-C-09</td><td class="c-req">Move all cards</td><td class="c-def">Bulk-move every card in a list to another list.</td></tr><tr data-blob="fr-c-10 archive all cards bulk-archive every card in a list in one action."><td class="c-id">FR-C-10</td><td class="c-req">Archive all cards</td><td class="c-def">Bulk-archive every card in a list in one action.</td></tr><tr data-blob="fr-c-11 list limits set a soft work-in-progress cap that visually flags an over-capacity list."><td class="c-id">FR-C-11</td><td class="c-req">List limits</td><td class="c-def">Set a soft work-in-progress cap that visually flags an over-capacity list.</td></tr><tr data-blob="fr-c-12 collapse list minimise a list horizontally to reduce visual noise."><td class="c-id">FR-C-12</td><td class="c-req">Collapse list</td><td class="c-def">Minimise a list horizontally to reduce visual noise.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="empty" hidden>Nothing in this module matches your search.</p><figure class="ui-fig rv"><div class="uibox spot" data-par data-speed="-0.03"><div class="uibar"><span class="uidot"></span><span class="uidot"></span><span class="uidot"></span><em>Interface concept</em></div><svg viewBox="0 0 760 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" class="ui"><defs>
